@startuml
title C2: Fintech System

package "Fintech" {
  [Billing Engine] --> [Invoice Generator]
  [Invoice Generator] --> [Payment Gateway]
  [Payment Gateway] --> [Bank API]
  [Payment Gateway] --> [Email Service]
  [Billing Engine] --> [Usage Tracker]
}

[Usage Tracker] --> [IaC System] : VM uptime
[Email Service] --> [Patient] : Счёт, подтверждение

note right of [Payment Gateway]
  Интеграция с:
  - Sber, Tinkoff
  - Apple Pay, Google Pay
end note

note right of [Billing Engine]
  Подписки, разовые платежи
  Скидки, купоны
end note

@enduml

